Draft one B2B cold email from Calendly for sales managers. Goal: invite a product demo via reply. Write an original conversational subject/body pair with enough useful detail. No verified recipient fields or account research; no fake observations or numbers. Local draft only, signature uses confirmed company name; flag required sending details briefly outside copy.
Previously fetched public website evidence; only these listed pages read, not a whole-site audit:
{"site":"Calendly","category":"Scheduling SaaS","readURLs":[{"requested":"https://calendly.com/","read":"https://calendly.com/","status":"read; canonical URL https://calendly.com"},{"requested":"https://calendly.com/scheduling","read":"https://calendly.com/scheduling","status":"read"}],"factual_offer_capabilities":["Online appointment and meeting scheduling with calendar connections, availability controls, booking links, and event templates.","Page describes reminders/follow-ups, website embeds and routing forms, team administration, 100+ integrations, mobile app, and browser extension.","Homepage also presents AI scheduling assistant Callie, meeting note-taking/recaps, and payments; Callie labeled beta on homepage."],"supported_CTA_terms":["Start for free / Get started for free; homepage says no credit card required.","Get a demo / Talk to sales are shown on the scheduling page/homepage.","Source pages support a scheduling or product demonstration invitation, not a claim of guaranteed time saved or outcomes."],"prohibited_inference_claim_limits":["Do not claim a prospect currently uses Calendly, has a scheduling problem, or uses a particular calendar without prospect-specific evidence.","Do not state current pricing or all features are free; pages do not establish those details.","Do not turn illustrative savings/customer story figures into typical or guaranteed results."],"source_extracts":[{"url":"https://calendly.com/","text":"Connect your calendars, set your hours, and control exactly when you're available to meet."},{"url":"https://calendly.com/scheduling","text":"Share your booking link wherever people connect with you: email, social media, your website, and more."}]}

