Draft one B2B cold email from Packhelp for ecommerce brand operations leads. Goal: invite a packaging consultation via reply. Write an original conversational subject/body pair with enough useful detail. No verified recipient fields or account research; no fake observations or numbers. Local draft only, signature uses confirmed company name; flag required sending details briefly outside copy.
