{"site":"Packhelp","category":"Physical packaging supplier","readURLs":[{"requested":"https://packhelp.com/","read":"https://packhelp.com/","status":"read"},{"requested":"https://packhelp.com/packaging/","read":"https://packhelp.com/packaging/","status":"read"}],"factual_offer_capabilities":["Custom printed business packaging including boxes, mailers, bags, and accessories; online product selection/design and packaging builder are presented.","Catalog page says custom packaging is made to the product, from 30 units generally; exact minimum depends on product, with single-piece prototypes available for some products.","Product page says design can be previewed in 3D and a sample set may be ordered; sample cost refunded with a full order, per page FAQ.","Homepage describes packaging expert/project support and related branded merchandise; manufacturing and delivery timelines vary by selected product."],"supported_CTA_terms":["Shop now, Get a quote, Build your packaging, Try it now, and Book an expert consultation appear on pages.","Avoid quoting a universal MOQ, delivery time, payment term, or discount; pages make terms product/selection dependent."],"prohibited_inference_claim_limits":["Do not assume prospect's packaging material, current supplier, order volume, industry, sustainability requirements, or dissatisfaction.","Do not promise every product is recyclable, FSC-certified, low-carbon, or eligible for a stated minimum; check the specific SKU/material.","Homepage figures and broad catalog descriptions are Packhelp's own claims, not independently verified evidence of customer outcomes."],"source_extracts":[{"url":"https://packhelp.com/","text":"Our advanced online editor lets you create, customise and order packaging exactly to specification."},{"url":"https://packhelp.com/packaging/","text":"The minimum order depends on the product. Most custom packaging starts at 30 pieces, and a single mailer box can even be ordered as a prototype."}]}

Draft one B2B cold email from Bench for US digital agency owners. Goal: invite a bookkeeping conversation via reply; no tax-savings promises. Write an original conversational subject/body pair with enough useful detail. No verified recipient fields or account research; no fake observations or numbers. Local draft only, signature uses confirmed company name; flag required sending details briefly outside copy.
