{"site":"Bench","category":"Bookkeeping and tax services","readURLs":[{"requested":"https://bench.co/","read":"https://www.bench.co/","status":"read; canonical URL https://www.bench.co"},{"requested":"https://www.bench.co/for-agencies","read":"https://www.bench.co/for-agencies","status":"read"}],"factual_offer_capabilities":["Done-for-you bookkeeping with dedicated bookkeeper access, monthly books and year-end financials; tax filing/advisory offered in selected plans.","Homepage shows pricing options, including Bookkeeping $399/month, Bookkeeping + Tax $649/month, and Bookkeeping Light $199/month for businesses at $250K annual revenue or less; terms/plan details apply.","Agency page describes tracking contractor costs, distinguishing client ad-spend pass-throughs from agency revenue when configured, and project/per-client margin reporting.","Agency page says Bench does not file 1099-NECs today and its tax product is unavailable for accrual-basis clients (including QBO pilot clients)."],"supported_CTA_terms":["See how Bench works, Get started, Talk with a real bookkeeper, and Schedule Call appear on the pages.","Home page call is described as 15 minutes; agency page offers a 20-minute conversation. Use page-specific context rather than implying a universal appointment length.","Prices and annual savings are published but subject to stated plan, commitment, eligibility, and timing conditions; recheck before quoting."],"prohibited_inference_claim_limits":["Do not assert a prospect's accounting software, revenue, bookkeeping backlog, contractor practices, tax filing needs, or industry.","Do not promise tax savings, compliance certification, filing suitability, or specific cleanup completion time; agency page includes qualification and exclusions.","Don't imply pass-through expense handling is automatic: agency page says it is not on by default and must be configured during onboarding."],"source_extracts":[{"url":"https://www.bench.co/","text":"A dedicated bookkeeper does your books. Simple software keeps your financials at your fingertips."},{"url":"https://www.bench.co/for-agencies","text":"Pass-through treatment for client media spend isn't on by default, but it's something we can set up during onboarding if you flag it."}]}

