, that all affiliates receive the recurring tier, or that applications are guaranteed approval.","kit.com homepage and /affiliates endpoint were blocked to static fetch; retrieved convertkit.com URLs redirected to accessible kit.com equivalents. Only two page contents were read."],"source_extracts":[{"url":"https://kit.com/","text":"14-day free trial. No credit card required. Migration included."},{"url":"https://kit.com/affiliate","text":"Refer 10 or more creators in a year and earn 10% recurring revenue for as long as they stay."}]}

